{
  "about": "Voice dictation quality corpus (voice dictation addendum 5.4, appendix B). Synthesized locally with the macOS `say` voices named here; the audio is generated on the machine that runs scripts/speech/eval.mjs and never committed or distributed. Synthetic speech compares models and catches regressions; it does not replace recordings of real speakers.",
